<SubSection title="Statically Indeterminate Problems - Torsion" id="torsion-statically_indeterminate_problems">

<Image src="/sol/torsion/Equilibrium.png" width="5">  Single element shear stresses </Image>

The stress distribution in the shaft is not known.
 <Itemize>
     <Item>Statically indeterminate: must consider shaft deformations. </Item>
     <Item>Multi-planar: equilibrium requires the existence of shear stresses on the faces formed by the two planes containing the axis of the shaft </Item>
 </Itemize>

